ds to commercial banks, not the rate for the described withdrawal.\"},{\"option\":\"D\",\"decisively_wrong\":true,\"basis\":\"direct_contradiction\",\"reason\":\"The stem explicitly distinguishes the repurchase arrangement from making an outright sale.\"}]}}"
